# Edge Function secrets for the "triage" function.
#
# Set these in the Supabase dashboard (Project Settings → Edge Functions →
# Manage secrets) or via:  supabase secrets set GROQ_API_KEY=...
# NEVER commit real values. This .example file is the only env file in git;
# the real .env is git-ignored (see supabase/.gitignore).
#
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are injected
# automatically by the platform at runtime — you do NOT need to set them.
# You only need to provide:

GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key-here

# Optional: set to "true" to store raw triage input text in ai_triage_logs.
# Leave unset/false to keep analytics metadata-only (recommended).
# LOG_TRIAGE_INPUT=false
